ry\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, August to September on the middle of the grids came in at 33% of normal and May to June at 178%. Grid 23610 had its driest year in 2001 at 67% of normal.</p>"}
